# The repository root ignores every data/ directory to keep large
# behaviour-cloning datasets (images + labels) out of git.
#
# This module instead ships two *small* labelled datasets (~0.7 MB in total)
# that are required inputs: `python main.py` reads imu_drive.json by default,
# and the two *_results.json files are the reproducible evaluation output.
# Re-include exactly those four files here instead of editing the shared root
# .gitignore or weakening its rule for the whole repository.
!data/
data/*
!data/imu_drive.json
!data/carla_drive.json
!data/sim_results.json
!data/carla_results.json
